nEvaluated after extended standby periods to maintain reliable printhead performance.\n\n</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"desceci-test-points\">\n\n\n<li>\n✓ 12 Hour Standby Test\n</li>\n\n<li>\n✓ 24 Hour Standby Test\n</li>\n\n<li>\n✓ 36 Hour Standby Test\n</li>\n\n<li>\n✓ Stable nozzle performance\n</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<!-- 03 -->\n\n\n<details class=\"desceci-test-item\">\n\n\n<summary class=\"desceci-test-summary\">\n\n\n<div class=\"desceci-test-summary__left\">\n\n\n<span class=\"desceci-test-number\">\n03\n</span>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"desceci-test-heading\">\n\n\n<h3>\nColor Fastness Performance\n</h3>\n\n\n<p>\nDurability after transfer\n</p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<span class=\"desceci-test-toggle\">\n+\n</span>\n\n\n</summary>\n\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"desceci-test-content\">\n\n\n<p class=\"desceci-test-intro\">\n\nTested for color durability after transfer application.\n\n</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"desceci-test-points\">\n\n\n<li>\n✓ Dry Rubbing: 4-5 Grade\n</li>\n\n\n<li>\n✓ Wet Rubbing: 3 Grade\n</li>\n\n\n<li>\n✓ Washing Resistance: 4-5 Grade\n</li>\n\n\n<li>\n✓ Excellent color retention\n</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n<p class=\"desceci-test-note\">\n\nGrade scale: 0-5, with 5 being the best performance.\n\n</p>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<!-- 04 -->\n\n\n<details class=\"desceci-test-item\">\n\n\n<summary class=\"desceci-test-summary\">\n\n\n<div class=\"desceci-test-summary__left\">\n\n\n<span class=\"desceci-test-number\">\n04\n</span>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"desceci-test-heading\">\n\n\n<h3>\nApplication Compatibility\n</h3>\n\n\n<p>\nSystem-level print application tests\n</p>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<span class=\"desceci-test-toggle\">\n+\n</span>\n\n\n</summary>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"desceci-test-content\">\n\n\n<p class=\"desceci-test-intro\">\n\nVerified across key DTF application scenarios for reliable production performance.\n\n</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"desceci-test-points\">\n\n\n<li>\n✓ Color density testing\n</li>\n\n\n<li>\n✓ White & color ink compatibility\n</li>\n\n\n<li>\n✓ Ink mixing stability\n</li>\n\n\n<li>\n✓ High ink volume printing test\n</li>\n\n\n<li>\n✓ Clean peel performance\n</li>\n\n\n</ul>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<style>\n\n\n.desceci-ink-testing{\n\n\npadding:55px 20px;\n\nbackground:#ffffff;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n.desceci-ink-testing__inner{\n\n\nmax-width:1180px;\n\nmargin:auto;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n\n.desceci-ink-testing__header{\n\n\ntext-align:center;\n\nmargin-bottom:35px;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n\n.desceci-ink-testing__eyebrow{\n\n\nfont-size:12px;\n\nletter-spacing:3px;\n\nfont-weight:600;\n\ncolor:#6f8664;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n\n.desceci-ink-testing__title{\n\n\nfont-size:36px;\n\nline-height:1.2;\n\nfont-weight:700;\n\ncolor:#111827;\n\nmargin:12px 0;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n\n\n.desceci-ink-testing__subtitle{\n\n\nfont-size:16px;\n\nline-height:1.6;\n\ncolor:#6b7280;\n\nmax-width:720px;\n\nmargin:auto;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n\n\n.desceci-ink-testing__accordion{\n\n\ndisplay:grid;\n\ngrid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);\n\ngap:18px;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n\n\n.desceci-test-item{\n\n\nbackground:#f8fafc;\n\nborder:1px solid #e5e7eb;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n\n.desceci-test-summary{\n\n\npadding:20px 22px;\n\ndisplay:flex;\n\njustify-content:space-between;\n\nalign-items:center;\n\ncursor:pointer;\n\nlist-style:none;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n.desceci-test-summary::-webkit-details-marker{\n\n\ndisplay:none;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n\n.desceci-test-summary__left{\n\n\ndisplay:flex;\n\nalign-items:center;\n\ngap:18px;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n\n\n.desceci-test-number{\n\n\nfont-size:32px;\n\nfont-weight:700;\n\ncolor:#6f8664;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n\n.desceci-test-heading h3{\n\n\nfont-size:22px;\n\nline-height:1.25;\n\nfont-weight:700;\n\ncolor:#111827;\n\nmargin:0 0 5px;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n\n.desceci-test-heading p{\n\n\nfont-size:14px;\n\ncolor:#6b7280;\n\nmargin:0;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n\n.desceci-test-toggle{\n\n\nfont-size:24px;\n\ncolor:#111827;\n\n\n}\n\n\n\n\n.desceci-test-content{\n\